---
---

<section class="opensource-section">
	<div class="section-container">
		<div class="section-header">
			<h2 class="section-title">Open Source</h2>
			<p class="section-subtitle">開源貢獻 - 程式碼禮物</p>
		</div>

		<div class="projects-list">
			<div class="project-item">
				<div class="project-content">
					<h3 class="project-name">
						<a href="https://github.com/daviddaytw/react-native-transformers" target="_blank" class="project-link-title">
							react-native-transformers
						</a>
					</h3>
					<p class="project-description">
						想在手機 App 裡跑 AI 模型？這個工具讓 Huggingface 的大語言模型能在 React Native 中飛奔！因為誰說 AI 只能活在雲端？
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="project-item">
				<div class="project-content">
					<h3 class="project-name">
						<a href="https://github.com/daviddaytw/ally-casdoor" target="_blank" class="project-link-title">
							ally-casdoor
						</a>
					</h3>
					<p class="project-description">
						讓 AdonisJS 和 Casdoor 成為好朋友的橋樑！OAuth2 登入從此不再是惡夢，而是一場優雅的舞蹈。
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="project-item">
				<div class="project-content">
					<h3 class="project-name">
						<a href="https://github.com/daviddaytw/davidday.tw/blob/2ed86bd662fcc99fa7cbff400b2cda1c0f368d7d/posts/media-bias/index.ipynb" target="_blank" class="project-link-title">
							量化評估臺灣新聞媒體偏見
						</a>
					</h3>
					<p class="project-description">
						用數據說話，看看台灣媒體到底有多偏？這不是政治立場，而是科學分析！
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.opensource-section {
		min-height: 100vh;
		background: #000;
		color: #fff;
		padding: 6rem 2rem;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.section-container {
		max-width: 1400px;
		width: 100%;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 3rem;
	}

	.section-header {
		margin-bottom: 5rem;
		border-bottom: 2px solid #fff;
		padding-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.section-title {
		font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
		font-weight: 300;
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
		line-height: 1;
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
		color: #fff;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.section-subtitle {
		font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
		font-weight: 200;
		color: #fff;
		opacity: 0.7;
		margin: 0;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
	}

	.projects-list {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0;
	}

	.project-item {
		background: #000;
		border-top: 2px solid #fff;
		overflow: hidden;
		transition: all 0.2s ease;
		position: relative;
	}

	.project-item:last-child {
		border-bottom: 2px solid #fff;
	}

	.project-item::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		right: 0;
		bottom: 0;
		background: #fff;
		transform: scaleX(0);
		transform-origin: right;
		transition: transform 0.4s ease;
		z-index: 0;
	}

	.project-item:hover::before {
		transform: scaleX(1);
		transform-origin: left;
	}

	.project-item:hover .project-content,
	.project-item:hover .project-name,
	.project-item:hover .project-link-title,
	.project-item:hover .project-description {
		color: #000;
	}

	.project-content {
		padding: 3rem;
		position: relative;
		z-index: 1;
		transition: color 0.3s ease;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 450px 1fr;
		gap: 3rem;
		align-items: flex-start;
	}

	.project-name {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.project-link-title {
		color: #fff;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: color 0.3s ease;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
		display: block;
		border-left: 4px solid #fff;
		padding-left: 1rem;
	}

	.project-item:hover .project-link-title {
		border-left-color: #000;
	}

	.project-description {
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: #fff;
		opacity: 0.9;
		margin: 0;
		transition: color 0.3s ease;
		flex: 1;
	}

	@media (max-width: 1024px) {
		.project-content {
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 1.5rem;
		}

		.project-name {
			min-width: 0;
		}

		.project-link-title {
			border-left: none;
			border-bottom: 2px solid #fff;
			padding-left: 0;
			padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
			display: inline-block;
		}

		.project-item:hover .project-link-title {
			border-left-color: transparent;
			border-bottom-color: #000;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.opensource-section {
			padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
		}

		.section-header {
			margin-bottom: 3rem;
		}

		.project-content {
			padding: 2rem;
		}

		.project-name {
			font-size: 1.25rem;
		}

		.project-description {
			font-size: 1rem;
		}
	}
</style>
